"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5092910","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1844115010504832","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v1.4.022 - Some changes around the shop","summary":"Hey everyone, I ended up changing quite a bit for this update. Some criticism about the game looking unoriginal because of the Synty characters got to me, and honestly, I took it personally. That pushed me to spend more time on the game's appearance. I'm still learning, and I don't think replacing some models suddenly solves everything. But it gave me a reason to revisit the customers, the shop and the apartment, along with some things that were confusing or just weren't working properly. Custom","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T16:50:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504832","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1844115010488074","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"announcement","title":"v1.4.020 - the freezes were my fault, and here's what they were","summary":"Some of you got a game that froze at the logo, or showed the main menu and then locked up on the loading screen, or ran at one frame every ten seconds. One review called it horrible. That was a fair word for what you got, and this update is mostly about it. What was actually happening The game ships its shaders pre-compiled so your graphics card doesn't have to do that work the first time the store draws. Except it didn't. For several builds the export reported that step as on, and it was quietl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T04:03:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1843481262698843","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"announcement","title":"A better day behind the counter","summary":"Hi everyone, I've been working through your recordings and reports. This Demo and Playtest update catches up on the changes since September 6, including fixes that reached the builds between posts. Quick highlights A new first-era computer look, inspired by Windows 2000/XP, with clearer orders and budgets. Better trade-ins and repairs, from grading a copy to opening the Nexus cartridge and using the tools. More natural hands and customers, with improved shelf pickups, basket unloading and paymen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T04:58:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1842846814451989","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out, and I redrew the covers and cutouts","summary":"Hey everyone! Last time I posted here was in August, before the demo was out. It's free to play now, and I've just put out its biggest update so far. https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46075832/a0ba28b90c89240f6fbeace6996955c57a348e13.png A lot of drawing Every game cover in the demo and all 99 cardboard cutouts are now hand-drawn by me. The whole game is about being a kid in a game store again, so I wanted the art on the shelves to come from that same place instead of looking profession","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T02:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451989","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1840944183786319","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"update","title":"Big Update: 823 changes since this page went up - play it free right now","summary":"I've been busyWhen this page went up in April I was just one person, building a game store sim with no budget, and that you could come and watch me build it. Since then there have been 823 changes to the game. Almost all of it landed in the playtest, which is free and open to everyone right now. Here's where the game is actually at now: The store starts empty. You build it.You don't inherit a furnished shop. You get a lit shell and a catalog, and the floor is yours. Buy and place every fixture y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T15:06:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786319","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4599010-1829528821308087","game_id":"steam-4599010","kind":"announcement","title":"We Just Went Live on Steam. The Journey Starts Here.","summary":"We have a Steam page! This is real now.I'm not here to announce a launch. The game isn't ready for that yet. But the Steam page is live, and that feels like a milestone worth sharing.I'm one person. I started with zero game dev experience. No team, no studio, no budget. Just an idea I couldn't shake: what if you could run your own game store, starting in the late '90s, and live through every console generation?So I started building it.What's already working🎮 Hands-on retail - Stock shelves, scan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T19:36:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821308087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4599010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4599010":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4599010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z"},"5092910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:13Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4599010","app_id":4599010,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:42Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f0e1c4e799baa29d793f09d9cb5ababc2f874503823f1f5c808318707c0296e8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Run the game store you never wanted to leave, from the late ’90s to today. Buy, sell and repair games, haggle over trade-ins, and hunt for rare finds. Customize your shop and fill your shelves with parodies that make you laugh, cringe, or remember the games you grew up with.","publishers":[{"name":"A Lone Dev"}],"developers":[{"name":"A Lone Dev"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Beta Gameplay Video","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792597861","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4599010/567497309/f6010623095ecb66ebcf3295fe77ba5ef85e244e/1789485801/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4599010/567497309/f6010623095ecb66ebcf3295fe77ba5ef85e244e/1789485801/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}]